{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"x","key":"h-8af4daa3b0","page":1,"pages":1,"total":10,"has_more":false,"items":[{"id":"x-turingou:2123426189692039675","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"今年 1 月开始，已经一年了，在沙箱这个赛道上，还没有成长出最终的产品形态和获胜的赢家","body":"今年 1 月开始，已经一年了，在沙箱这个赛道上，还没有成长出最终的产品形态和获胜的赢家","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123426189692039675","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:40:29+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"tonychang430","display_name":"Tony Chang ☁️","text":"The sandbox market is CROWDED AF\n\nBut I still think we're early in figuring out what compute (and even infrastructure) should look like for agents.\n\nCompute is finite and agent demand isn’t slowing down.\n\nThe first step is figuring out how to orchestrate containers and microVMs more intelligently. Better resource sharing, higher utilization, faster startup, and tighter control over the infrastructure underneath our sandboxes.\n\nBut that’s only the tip of the iceberg.\n\nI want to go deeper: Kernels, networking, storage, operating systems. Every layer of the stack deserves to be rethought for agents.\n\nCompeting mainly on price feels like a trap to me. A slightly lower price can just mean a smaller margin, without changing what the infrastructure can do.\n\nI’m much more interested in unlocking things that aren’t practical today.\n\nImagine one agent forking its live sandbox into a million isolated environments in seconds, each inheriting its memory and execution state.\n\nNow imagine those forks spawning more forks. Millions becoming billions. Each branch exploring a different path, preserving its own state, and sharing discoveries through agent-to-agent (A2A) communication.\n\nI don't think anyone has figured out the winning approach yet...","url":"https://x.com/tonychang430/status/2123106480194826389","published_at":"2026-11-19T01:30:04+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":23,"view":8821,"like":35,"quote":1,"reply":5,"repost":0}},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123420515134218640","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"几个月之前《润日》的作者去美国做访问学者之前的采访视频，今天终于发布了！","body":"几个月之前《润日》的作者去美国做访问学者之前的采访视频，今天终于发布了！","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123420515134218640","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:17:56+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"hiromocean","display_name":"Takehiro Masutomo","text":"【動画更新】TikTokの開発に初期段階から関わっていらっしゃった郭宇 (@turingou) さんに、ご自身の生い立ち、東京に移住してきた理由、ByteDance社の当時の雰囲気、最近の暮らしぶり、友人と定期開催している読書会の模様などについて詳しくお話をうかがいました。https://t.co/WeQPQ66sWk","url":"https://x.com/hiromocean/status/2123341761582158244","published_at":"2026-11-19T17:05:00+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":19,"view":11035,"like":34,"quote":0,"reply":2,"repost":2}},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123414123065254367","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"自我是一种幻觉。","body":"自我是一种幻觉。","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123414123065254367","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T21:52:32+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"micahgallen","display_name":"Micah G. Allen","text":"A meta-analysis of 912 neuroimaging studies finds no single core brain region or network underlying the self, challenging the prevailing view of a shared cortical midline or insular anchor. Instead, self-related processing emerges from contextually determined, shifting coalitions of distributed brain systems, suggesting that selfhood is defined by dynamic configuration rather than a fixed neural substrate.","url":"https://x.com/micahgallen/status/2123071235869245593","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:10:02+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":29,"view":9964,"like":54,"quote":2,"reply":2,"repost":7}},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123399083335590115","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"太离谱了！Nuance Labs 这个数字人是我目前用过最自然的数字人，而且它的反应非常快！","body":"太离谱了！Nuance Labs 这个数字人是我目前用过最自然的数字人，而且它的反应非常快！","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123399083335590115","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123398919745073153/img/u0dvYImoATgNgxFB.jpg","width":1408,"height":640},"published_at":"2026-11-19T20:52:46+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123398919745073153/vid/avc1/1408x640/GGvCt3RAfqumgLLV.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123398919745073153/img/u0dvYImoATgNgxFB.jpg","duration_ms":244163}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":383,"view":50952,"like":438,"quote":4,"reply":20,"repost":45},"comments":[{"handle":"tonnyzhou","display_name":"Tonny｜AI Builder","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105692549394714624/e8FIkeTE_400x400.jpg","text":"视频里这反应速度确实离谱，好奇真聊起来被打断几次还稳不稳。","published_at":"2026-11-19T21:06:42+08:00","url":"https://x.com/tonnyzhou/status/2123402588511146435","like":0},{"handle":"Hayami_kiraa","display_name":"早见Hayami","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046158892506267648/HFMBulGd_400x400.jpg","text":"好多嘴部肌肉的小表情（抿嘴、笑、准备抢话时微微张开）都好逼真","published_at":"2026-11-19T21:06:27+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Hayami_kiraa/status/2123402526544560613","like":0},{"handle":"bytecode_w","display_name":"星期六","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108076803193769984/XsDypSOr_400x400.jpg","text":"反应快好判断，接话时还像不像念稿才见自然","published_at":"2026-11-19T20:59:25+08:00","url":"https://x.com/bytecode_w/status/2123400754329526688","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123374202220867910","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"时间过得真快！马上又要到圣诞季了🎄","body":"时间过得真快！马上又要到圣诞季了🎄","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123374202220867910","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5YagAIdUFL.jpg","width":1536,"height":2048},"published_at":"2026-11-19T19:13:54+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5YagAIdUFL.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5OasAENL-I.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5SaAAAKqQn.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5XbIAA8O-s.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5RasAA2zVh.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXe9j5YaQAAKyvs.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":8,"view":37861,"like":86,"quote":0,"reply":3,"repost":1},"comments":[{"handle":"wolfqing1","display_name":"wolfqing 庆哥","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2017813832710950915/flKrt66D_400x400.jpg","text":"等圣诞装","published_at":"2026-11-19T19:21:58+08:00","url":"https://x.com/wolfqing1/status/2123376229705552048","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123331809299616121","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"下午集中 review 了一波 Claude Code 和 Codex 自带的这个云环境，我发现这些云环境比我想象的要强大很多。虽然这些机器都是临时的，但是按照现在的订阅账户来算，如果不使用这些机器完全就浪费掉了。所以我把公司的东京开发服务器的一系列工作流程平滑地迁徙到了一份云电脑兼容配置的版本上去。那通过这种方式，我觉得未来适应一段时间就可以把东京服务器完全做成构建和部署服务器，而去掉开发相关的…","body":"下午集中 review 了一波 Claude Code 和 Codex 自带的这个云环境，我发现这些云环境比我想象的要强大很多。虽然这些机器都是临时的，但是按照现在的订阅账户来算，如果不使用这些机器完全就浪费掉了。所以我把公司的东京开发服务器的一系列工作流程平滑地迁徙到了一份云电脑兼容配置的版本上去。那通过这种方式，我觉得未来适应一段时间就可以把东京服务器完全做成构建和部署服务器，而去掉开发相关的工作。从长期来看，这个趋势个人计算设备其实并不是在增强，而是在减弱。它的地位越来越更像是作为一个显示屏和成果交付的一个终端设备而存在。做完这件事情之后，我会把我所有的 Mac mini 和 Mac Studio 全部作为 CI 电脑配置，将所有开发工作都迁移到这些订阅套餐提供的云电脑当中。","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123331809299616121","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:25:27+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":50,"view":24146,"like":89,"quote":1,"reply":10,"repost":1}},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123276231554548169","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"今天 Claude Code 的额度又没了。 这个礼拜因为大部分时间在外面旅游，刚回到东京，所以其实用得不是特别频繁，90% 以上的时间都是用手机操作云端环境的项目来自动化执行的。 我发现推理和计算放在一起的好处，就是 Claude Code 的云端环境基本上可以胜任 80% 到 90% 以上的自动化工作，而无需依赖任何权限、弹出任何卡片。而且它还有一个比较好的方式，是你可以将云端环境复制到其他的…","body":"今天 Claude Code 的额度又没了。\n\n这个礼拜因为大部分时间在外面旅游，刚回到东京，所以其实用得不是特别频繁，90% 以上的时间都是用手机操作云端环境的项目来自动化执行的。\n\n我发现推理和计算放在一起的好处，就是 Claude Code 的云端环境基本上可以胜任 80% 到 90% 以上的自动化工作，而无需依赖任何权限、弹出任何卡片。而且它还有一个比较好的方式，是你可以将云端环境复制到其他的 Claude Code 账号。\n\n很久以前，我曾经用自己东京的服务器做主要的构建和开发机器，但切换到新的云端环境之后，它将大部分自动化工作都内化了。所以当它操作我的东京服务器时，要求的权限卡片甚至比直接在东京服务器上操作还要麻烦得多，所以我现在将大量的自动开发工作迁移到 Claude Code 内置的云端项目，也就是它的云环境当中。\n\n很多个人助理都内置一个云环境。这些云环境因为是共享机器，经常重建，但性能应该还是蛮强的，几乎可以安装任何你要求安装的东西，比如 Chrome 浏览器或者 Blender。\n\n通过这种方式，你可以在云环境的初始脚本里面去做自动化的备份和拉取。一旦云环境重建之后，就可以让它把你 Chrome 上登录的账号再 restore 回来。至于资源，比如说 Cloudflare 或者甚至是公司的 Stripe 的可读 Key，你都可以在云环境的密钥库当中进行配置。\n\n这样可以确保，无论你使用多少号的后端账号，都可以在不同的临时云环境当中，通过和 GitHub 项目的组合，来完成全自动化的公司产品开发、营销流转，以及根据商业化情况来实现的自动化实验。\n\n使用云环境还有一个非常好的潜在好处，就是刚才说到的推理和计算在同一处。\n\n推理完的结果不需要远渡重洋传到我的个人电脑上来计算、再把结果传回去。这样单次推理加计算比传统方式能节省数百毫秒，一天下来，累加起来的优势还是蛮大的。\n\n如果你订阅 Claude Code 或者是最高级的 Grok，而没有充分使用它的云环境的话，其实还是蛮浪费的。这就相当于给这些 SOTA 模型的订阅账户赠送了额外强大的计算空间。\n\n同时，像 OpenAI 和 Claude Code 还会为 $200 和 $500 的订阅账户赠送对应的 API 额度。这些 API 额度可以在他们的开发者平台创建 API Key，在云环境当中配置好之后，就能直接实现图像生成或者视频处理，完全不需要再经过额外的 CLI 工具就可以实现","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123276231554548169","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:44:36+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"turingou","display_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870511184761483265/QO7R0Ow3_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":133,"view":37898,"like":153,"quote":5,"reply":13,"repost":7},"comments":[{"handle":"sahuaja3669","display_name":"老王实验室","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107470619965353984/taQsgPb4_400x400.jpg","text":"临时环境这一点值得单独验收：假设现在把环境重建，未提交的修改、任务进度和生成的交付物还能回来多少？能拉起依赖，只证明环境能启动；能接着上次的工作继续，才算工作台搬过去了。","published_at":"2026-11-19T13:06:17+08:00","url":"https://x.com/sahuaja3669/status/2123281687597776982","like":0},{"handle":"misselvexu","display_name":"Hailey 海莉","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111829835978874880/kicRLRJn_400x400.jpg","text":"手机遥控云端干活，旅游都不耽误烧额度","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:55:23+08:00","url":"https://x.com/misselvexu/status/2123278945080717470","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-turingou:2123110170385625137","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-turingou","source_name":"郭宇 guoyu.eth","title":"","summary":"我突然觉得，在东京可以随便买到新的 Mac mini，真的是很难得的一件事！","body":"我突然觉得，在东京可以随便买到新的 Mac mini，真的是很难得的一件事！","url":"https://x.com/turingou/status/2123110170385625137","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:44:44+08:0